{"id":"n75902-1-8","stage":4,"title":"정점 · 顶点","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75902-1-8-1","ko":"이 산의 정점에는 커다란 바위가 있어.","zh":"这座山的山顶上有一块巨大的岩石。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산의","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정점에는","meaning":"顶点","explanation":"정점：顶点；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"정점","audio":"/audio/b4f3f750449768210216.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75902","senseId":"1","lemma":"정점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커다란","meaning":"很大，巨大","explanation":"커다랗다：很大，巨大；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"커다랗다","audio":"/audio/96ead858a45ebd1d3bee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72164","senseId":"1","lemma":"커다랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바위가","meaning":"岩石","explanation":"바위：岩石；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바위","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57558","senseId":"1","lemma":"바위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"b4f3f75044976821","term":"정점","zh":"顶点","audio":"/audio/b4f3f750449768210216.mp3","entryId":"75902","definition":"最高点。","pronunciation":["정쩜"]},{"id":"96ead858a45ebd1d","term":"커다랗다","zh":"很大，巨大","audio":"/audio/96ead858a45ebd1d3bee.mp3","entryId":"72164","definition":"非常大。","pronunciation":["커ː다라타"]},{"id":"e51e6c52f2963665","term":"바위","zh":"岩石","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3","entryId":"57558","definition":"非常大的石头。","pronunciation":["바위"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d6428ea5649ab953d57.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75902-1-8-2","ko":"그래? 어서 올라가서 그 바위를 봐야겠다.","zh":"是吗？那我得赶紧上去看看那块岩石。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라가서","meaning":"上，上去","explanation":"올라가다：上，上去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바위를","meaning":"岩石","explanation":"바위：岩石；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"바위","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57558","senseId":"1","lemma":"바위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐야겠다.","meaning":"试，试图","explanation":"보다：试，试图；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，上去","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"从下向上，从低处前往高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"e51e6c52f2963665","term":"바위","zh":"岩石","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3","entryId":"57558","definition":"非常大的石头。","pronunciation":["바위"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ab455fa1b769573f80b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75902","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这座山的山顶上有一块巨大的岩石。","是吗？那我得赶紧上去看看那块岩石。","接下来我们就进入问答环节吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这座山的山顶上有一块巨大的岩石。","是吗？那我得赶紧上去看看那块岩石。","接下来我们就进入问答环节吧。"],"answer":1}]}
